<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>U.S. states - VWF example site</title>
</head>
<body>
	<h1>U.S. states</h1>
	<p>This page is rendered by the states page class from
	<code>example/templates/web/Web/VWF/Display/states.tmpl</code>.  The rows
	are read from <code>example/data/states.csv</code> through
	<code>Web::VWF::Data::states</code>.</p>
	<table>
		<thead>
			<tr><th>Code</th><th>Abbreviation</th><th>Name</th></tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody>
[% FOREACH row IN states %]
			<tr><td>[% row.state | html %]</td><td>[% row.abbreviation | html %]</td><td>[% row.name | html %]</td></tr>
[% END %]
		</tbody>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
